privacy='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Privacy | Digits Studio</title><link rel="icon" href="brand/favicon.svg"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/site.css"></head><body><header class="header"><a class="brand" href="./"><img src="brand/logo-primary.svg" width="184" height="56" alt="Digits Studio"></a><a href="./#contact">Contact Ahmad</a></header><main class="legal"><h1>Privacy, plainly.</h1><p>Updated 27 October 2026.</p><h2>Your project inquiry</h2><p>The inquiry form prepares a brief for you to review. If you choose direct email delivery, your name, email, business, selected services, approximate budget, timing and message are processed by the website server and Resend to send the brief to Ahmad. Nothing is sent until you choose a sending action. You can also choose WhatsApp or your own email app.</p><p>If you choose to send a message, the service you use processes it under its own privacy policy. Ahmad receives the information you send and uses it to discuss your project.</p><h2>Website hosting</h2><p>The hosting provider may process technical request information to deliver and secure the website. Vercel Web Analytics and Speed Insights measure page use and loading performance without marketing cookies. We do not include inquiry contents or contact fields in these measurements. No advertising pixels are included.</p><h2>External websites</h2><p>Portfolio and contact links open external services with their own policies. The English and Arabic pages are provided locally; changing language does not require a user account.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>To ask about information you have sent, email <a href="mailto:hello@digitsstudio.online">hello@digitsstudio.online</a>.</p><section lang="ar" dir="rtl"><h2>الخصوصية باختصار</h2><p>يجهّز النموذج طلبك للمراجعة. عند اختيار الإرسال المباشر، يعالج خادم الموقع وخدمة Resend اسمك وبريدك واسم شركتك والخدمات والميزانية والموعد والرسالة لإرسال الطلب إلى أحمد. لا تُرسل بياناتك قبل اختيار الإرسال. يمكنك أيضاً استخدام واتساب أو تطبيق البريد. نقيس استخدام الصفحات وسرعة التحميل عبر أدوات Vercel، دون تضمين محتوى الطلب أو بيانات التواصل في هذه القياسات، ودون ملفات تعريف ارتباط تسويقية.</p><p>للاستفسار، راسل أحمد على البريد أعلاه.</p></section><a class="button" href="./">Back to the studio</a></main></body></html>'''
(DIST/'privacy.html').write_text(privacy,encoding='utf-8')
(DIST/'robots.txt').write_text('User-agent: *\nAllow: /\nSitemap: https://digitsstudio.online/sitemap.xml\n',encoding='utf-8')
